                "Maintenance active" badge, amber "Within 24h" chip, freshness chip, refresh);
                active body (operator message + "Active until {dt} (N min remaining)" / "Until {dt}"
                + amber Clear); scheduler idle (explainer + "Schedule a window"); inline form
                (DatePicker start, numeric duration min-5/max-1440-default-60, optional message
                maxLength 500, Cancel / Schedule). Native primitives per Apple HIG (DatePicker
                replaces web datetime-local input), no Tailwind ports — P1/S9 tokens only.
  handleSchedule: durMin = max(5, Number(duration)||60); end = start + durMin*60_000; message =
                trim() || "Scheduled maintenance · ends {dt}"; until = new Date(end).toISOString().
                Reproduced verbatim + unit tested (incl. the "0"/""/"abc" -> 60 falsy fallback).
